---

This project is a port of WeatherStar 4000+ (https://github.com/netbymatt/ws4kp)
by Matt Walsh, also MIT licensed. The Star4000 fonts, weather icons, background
artwork, default music and the generated city/station tables originate there.

Sun and moon calculations are ported from SunCalc
(https://github.com/mourner/suncalc) by Vladimir Agafonkin, BSD-2-Clause.

Weather data is provided by the National Weather Service (NOAA) and is in the
public domain. Radar composites are served by the Iowa Environmental Mesonet.
Convective outlooks come from the NOAA Storm Prediction Center.

Not affiliated with, endorsed by, or connected to The Weather Channel or NOAA.
